# --- Twilio Configuration ---
# To use live Twilio delivery, set your live Account SID, Auth Token, and Twilio phone number.
# If left unset or set to AC_MOCK_..., the worker automatically runs in simulation mode
# using the Twilio Node.js SDK interface.
